      "id": "claim_fa3fde1493a04e96a695301bfc39b002",
      "statement": "The dispatcher is a small LangGraph state graph with `list_claims`, `work_claim`, and `finish_run`; it fans out work with `Send`, sets concurrency from the run record, and is not compiled with a checkpointer.",
